{"id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-creative-set.md","title":"Creative Set","display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-creative-set","aliases":["92-df-creative-set"],"display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的 c.e. 集结构与生产力背景；须采用已指定的可接受编号，创造性结论不是任意相容理论的无条件性质","source_status":"外部递归论定义或定理"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-creative-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-creative-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-creative-set — Creative Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的 c.e. 集结构与生产力背景；须采用已指定的可接受编号，创造性结论不是任意相容理论的无条件性质"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部递归论定义或定理"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> (partial-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed acceptable effective enumeration of the computably enumerable subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (definition target creative-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\n\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap(\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\Longrightarrow\ne\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\land p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\setminus W_e\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\n\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap(\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\Longrightarrow\ne\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\land p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\setminus W_e\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是创造集</li>\n<li>创造集是r.e.集，但不是递归的</li>\n<li>生产力函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 可以是部分递归的，但在每个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq A^c\">\\(W_e\\subseteq A^c\\)</span> 的索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 上必须停机并输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^c\\setminus W_e\">\\(A^c\\setminus W_e\\)</span> 的元素</li>\n<li>创造集不可判定</li>\n<li>创造集多一完全（所有r.e.集可归约到它）</li>\n<li>对足够强、相容且递归可公理化的算术理论，其定理码集可证明为创造集；需要保留这些理论与编码假设</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable predicate, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ (partial-recursive function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\n\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\cap(\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\Longrightarrow\ne\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\land p(e)\\in(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\setminus W_e\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"W_e\\subseteq A^c","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"A^c\\setminus W_e","display":false}],"bytes":1734,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1cdd4c4623e324f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Creative}$ (creative-set predicate, see [[92-df-creative-set]])"},{"id":"91aef0bb06ab9396","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Creative}$ (creative-set predicate, see [[92-df-creative-set]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-creative-set]]"}],"outgoing":["69a2a133da01f9c9","d65795dc15ebce4b"]}